WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,030
boss

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,070
good guy

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,630
You call this going out on an adventure

4
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,590
You and the others have not only armed themselves to the point of shaking the ruler

5
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:10,030
