9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,560
Well let's go

10
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:24,480
One hundred parts of water and bread for one hundred bodyguards

11
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,120
Precautions can also help you escape

12
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,960
Senior Hanamaru is in pain only after he has endured death. As long as he is alive

13
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:31,160
Just brush some monsters and they will be transferred back

14
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,680
Boss, it's too dark

15
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:34,880
Go straight in which direction

16
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,440
Go to the abandoned city ahead
